{"ticker":"COO","updated":"2026-11-20T22:46:36Z","profile":{"longName":"The Cooper Companies, Inc.","shortName":"The Cooper Companies, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","country":"United States","website":"https://www.coopercos.com","fullTimeEmployees":15000,"marketCap":11196344320,"trailingPE":20.233677,"forwardPE":12.547656,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.6425793,"pegRatio":0.57,"targetMeanPrice":65.8,"targetHighPrice":75.0,"targetLowPrice":58.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.006,"earningsGrowth":3.571,"grossMargins":0.65928,"operatingMargins":0.12934,"profitMargins":0.1346,"totalRevenue":4236900096,"beta":0.818,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":89.83,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":51.01,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"The Cooper Companies, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, develops, manufactures, and markets contact lens wearers. The company operates in two segments, CooperVision and CooperSurgical. The CooperVision segment offers spherical, toric, and multifocal contact lenses that address vision challenges, such as astigmatism, presbyopia, and myopia. Its CooperSurgical segment focuses on family and women's health care, which provides fertility products and services, medical devices, and contraception, as well as cryostorage, such as cord blood and cord tissue storage. This segment offers Paragard, a hormone-free intrauterine device; and fertility consumables and equipment, donor gamete services, and genomic services, including genetic testing. The company sells its products to distributors, group purchasing organizations, eye care and health care professionals, including independent practices, corporate retailers, hospitals and clinics, and authorized resellers. The Cooper Companies, Inc. was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in San Ramon, California.","summary_zh":"Cooper Companies, Inc. 及其子公司開發、製造和銷售隱形眼鏡配戴者。該公司分為兩個部門：CooperVision 和 CooperSurgical。 CooperVision 部門提供球面、複曲面和多焦點隱形眼鏡，可解決散光、老花眼和近視等視力挑戰。其 CooperSurgical 部門專注於家庭和婦女醫療保健，提供生育產品和服務、醫療設備、避孕以及低溫儲存，例如臍帶血和臍帶組織儲存。此細分市場提供 Paragard，一種無激素子宮內避孕器；生育耗材和設備、供體配子服務以及基因組服務，包括基因檢測。該公司將其產品銷售給分銷商、團體採購組織、眼部保健和醫療保健專業人士，包括獨立診所、企業零售商、醫院和診所以及授權經銷商。 The Cooper Companies, Inc. 成立於 1958 年，總部位於加州聖拉蒙。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材及用品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":67.68,"h":68.4,"l":66.84,"c":68.0,"v":2880000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":68.0,"h":68.46,"l":67.22,"c":67.5,"v":3007200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":67.26,"h":68.41,"l":66.86,"c":68.35,"v":2467700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":67.72,"h":67.97,"l":66.56,"c":66.89,"v":3943400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":66.95,"h":67.81,"l":66.59,"c":67.55,"v":2967100},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":67.73,"h":68.44,"l":66.98,"c":67.67,"v":1995200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":67.64,"h":68.67,"l":67.38,"c":68.56,"v":1743300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":67.67,"h":68.24,"l":66.82,"c":68.07,"v":4741900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":67.86,"h":69.7,"l":66.84,"c":69.12,"v":2479900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":69.26,"h":71.02,"l":69.18,"c":70.46,"v":1547200},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":70.6,"h":70.6,"l":69.67,"c":70.11,"v":2098900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":70.21,"h":70.53,"l":68.96,"c":69.02,"v":1881600},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":69.05,"h":70.53,"l":68.55,"c":70.26,"v":1770300},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":70.12,"h":70.83,"l":69.59,"c":69.75,"v":2399100},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":69.82,"h":70.03,"l":67.83,"c":68.37,"v":2465900},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":69.4,"h":69.8,"l":68.49,"c":69.3,"v":2971300},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":68.72,"h":71.98,"l":68.36,"c":71.21,"v":2452400},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":71.71,"h":71.87,"l":68.7,"c":68.76,"v":4759100},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":69.25,"h":72.16,"l":68.49,"c":71.56,"v":5394400},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":71.2,"h":72.47,"l":70.71,"c":71.97,"v":2372200},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":76.02,"h":76.22,"l":73.48,"c":74.99,"v":4088700},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":74.67,"h":75.64,"l":74.42,"c":75.0,"v":2595400},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":75.0,"h":75.6,"l":74.41,"c":74.45,"v":2002300},{"t":"2025-10-23","o":74.4,"h":74.9